  m_Name: L5_ShadowGoodEndPhase_1.5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - Still snapping away, huh? You think a few flashes of light make you 'better'?
    All you're doing is hurting your eyes.
  - "You\u2019re trying to burn me out of the frame, but I\u2019m the one who kept
    you company when the house went quiet!"
  - "I\u2019m the one who understood the weight in your chest! And look... you think
    I'm the only thing you have to fear?"
  - "Look at the horizon, Minh. Do you hear it? The 'real' world is coming. The world
    that thinks you\u2019re a burden. The world that wants you to 'get over it' before
    you've even had a chance to say goodbye."
  - "Now... He\u2019s coming for you, 'shutter-bug.' And he doesn't care about your
    grief... he only cares about your 'progress.'"
  - ... The Overexposed.
